      "the sandbox was created without a policy of its own; the gateway's default applied, which the committed sandbox does not carry"
     ]
    },
    "policy_revisions": {
     "enum": [
      "a policy change's committed response does not name its sandbox, so changes after the start are not recorded"
     ]
    },
    "prover_result": {
     "enum": [
      "the gateway's prover checks policy proposals and keeps its verdicts in its own store"
     ]
    },
